ds played {played}":"旅程 {done}/{total} · 成就 {ach}/{achTotal} · 玩咗一輪 {played}","cloud save synced":"雲端存檔已同步","saving…":"儲存中…","cloud save offline":"雲端儲存離線","Callable now: {list}.":"而家可呼叫：{list}。","Pattern complete — press Claim!":"圖案完成 — 按申索！","Nothing callable yet. Wait for the next call.":"仲未有嘢可以叫。等下一個電話。","Opponents: {n} lantern":"對手： {n} 燈籠","Opponents: {n} lanterns":"對手： {n} 燈籠","(auto in {n}s)":"({n}秒後自動)","(manual calls)":"(手動叫牌)","Play":"開始遊戲","Journey":"旅程","Daily":"每日","Learn":"學習","Hosted Play":"主持遊戲","Mode Setup":"模式設定","Start":"開始","Back":"返回","Your bingo card":"你張賓果卡","Hall":"霍爾","Call":"跟注","Claim":"領取","Undo":"復原","Hint":"提示","Pause":"暫停","Retry":"重試","Copy Replay":"複製重播","Audio":"音效","Theme":"主題","Ember Court":"餘燼庭院","Jade Garden":"翡翠花園","River Night":"河夜","Plum Festival":"梅節","Paper Dawn":"紙張黎明","Accessibility & Controls":"無障礙與控制","Left-handed action tray":"左手操作托盤","Call speed":"呼叫速度","Fast (3s)":"快（3秒）","Normal (5s)":"正常（5秒）","Relaxed (8s)":"放鬆（8秒）","Manual only":"只限手動","Hint markable cells":"提示可標記嘅細胞","Done":"完成","How to Play":"玩法說明","Mark calls":"馬克打嚟","Complete the pattern":"完成圖案","Claim first":"首先佔領","Keyboard":"鍵盤","Scoring":"計分","Fair play":"公平遊戲","Numbers are drawn one at a time and shown on the lantern ball. If a called number is on your card, select that cell to mark it (<kbd>Enter</kbd> or tap).":"數字係一次過抽出一個，然後顯示喺燈籠球上面。如果你張卡上面有個被叫嘅號碼，揀嗰個儲存格嚟標記佢（ <kbd>Enter</kbd> 或者㩒一下）。","Each round names a target pattern — a line, corners, a frame, or the full card. The objective panel always shows the current target.":"每一輪都會命名一個目標模式 — 一條線、一個角落、一個框架或者全張卡片。目標面板永遠都會顯示當前目標。","When your marks complete the target pattern, press <strong>Claim</strong> (<kbd>C</kbd>) before the other lanterns do. False claims cost score.":"當你嘅標記完成目標圖案，喺其他燈籠完成之前，按下 <strong> 申索 </strong> （ <kbd>C</kbd> ）。虛假索償成本分數。","Pattern 1000 · each line +50 · each mark +10 · speed bonus under par · invalid action −25. Ties break on completion, fewer invalid actions, then faster claim.":"模式1000 · 每行 + 50 · 每個標記 + 10 · 標準下嘅速度加成 · 無效動作 -25。完成嗰陣，關係就會斷開，無效嘅行動就會少啲，然後申索就會快啲。","Every round is seeded and replayable. Daily seeds are fixed per UTC day and identical for everyone.":"每一輪都係種子同可重播。每日種子係每個 UTC 日固定，所有人都一樣。","Any Line":"任何線","Complete any row, column, or diagonal.":"完成任何一行、一列或者一條斜線。","Two Lines":"兩條線","Complete any two different lines.":"完成任何兩條唔同嘅線。","Diagonal":"對角線","Complete either main diagonal.":"完成任何一條主斜線。","Four Corners":"四個角落","Mark all four corners of the card.":"標記卡片嘅四個角落。","Lantern Frame":"燈籠架","Mark every cell on the outer edge.":"標記外邊嘅每個儲存格。","Crossed Light":"交叉光","Complete both diagonals (an X).":"完成兩條斜線（一個 X）。","Mark every cell on the card.":"標記卡上嘅每個儲存格。","Marking a Call":"標記一個電話","Numbers are called one at a time. A glowing ball shows the current call.":"數字係一次過叫一個。發光嘅球會顯示當前嘅通話。","If the called number is on your card, tap it to mark it. Mark the glowing cell now.":"如果被叫嘅號碼喺你張卡上面，㩒一下佢就可以標記佢。而家標記發光嘅細胞。","Lines and Claims":"行同索償","Five marked cells in a row, column, or diagonal complete a line.":"一行、一欄或對角線嘅五個標記儲存格完成一條線。","Keep marking called numbers until a line is complete.":"繼續標記被叫號碼，直至一行完成為止。","A line is complete! Press CLAIM to win the round before anyone else.":"一條線完成！喺其他人之前撳「領取」嚟贏呢回合。","Target Patterns":"目標模式","Some rounds need a special pattern. This one needs the FOUR CORNERS.":"有啲彈需要特別嘅圖案。呢個需要四個角落。","Mark corner numbers as they are called, then claim. Corners glow faintly to guide you.":"標記角落數字嘅名稱，然後申索。角落會發出淡淡嘅光芒，引導你。","Speed Lantern":"速度燈籠","Win in 38 calls or fewer.":"喺38次或以下嘅電話中贏。","Iron Frame":"鐵架","Complete the outer frame.":"完成外框。","Steady Hand":"穩定單手","Win with zero invalid actions.":"用零個無效嘅動作贏。","Full Glow":"全發光","Black out the entire card.":"成張卡塗黑。","tap":"輕點","number called":"電話號碼打咗嚟","marked":"標記咗","not allowed":"不允許","line complete":"行完成","bingo! round won":"bingo ！贏咗一輪","round lost":"回合失敗","round begins":"回合開始","achievement unlocked":"成就解鎖","Hosted hall — waiting for the round to start.":"主持大堂 — 等緊個回合開始。","Volumes, mute, graphics quality, language, reduced motion, high contrast and text size are in the StarHermit Options.":"音量、靜音、畫質、語言、減少動畫、高對比同文字大小都喺 StarHermit 選項入面。","Open Options":"開啟選項","Change keys and buttons":"更改按鍵同按鈕","Arrow keys move between cells, {mark} marks ({call} marks a focused cell, otherwise calls), {claim} claim, {undo} undo in Practice, {hint} hint, {pause} pause, {camera} reset camera, {back} back.":"方向鍵喺格仔之間移動，{mark} 標記（{call} 標記聚焦格仔，否則呼叫），{claim} 索取，{undo} 練習中撤銷，{hint} 提示，{pause} 暫停，{camera} 重置鏡頭，{back} 返回。","{n} of {max} seats taken — empty seats play as lanterns.":"{max} 嘅 {n} 座位攞咗 — 空位玩燈籠。","Start round":"開始回合","Waiting for the host to start the round…":"等緊主持人開始回合 …","Playing as {name}":"以 {name} 身份遊玩"}
